&lt;li&gt;Strong Go or C++ expertise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large-scale distributed systems (10k+ RPS, billions of URLs, high-throughput pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
