&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern deep learning for language processing and generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience with training large models on multiple computational nodes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills (we mostly use python)&lt;/li&gt;
