&lt;li&gt;Ability to document research findings clearly and contribute to technical publications or report&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
